Subject: [PATCH] cl-6.dev@PrompTugal.dinis: status page: the tablet 'More'
 fold and the left rail from 1100 px

The row keeps eight pages and 'More' opens the rest on a line of its own (two lines at most at 700 px and over); from 1100 px the page list is a left rail beside the cards and the counts; under 700 px it stays the closed fold. cl-6.designer's last round, 28 Nov.

